        <p>This work is not approached as a rigid programme or one-size-fits-all system. Each young man arrives with a different personality, developmental history, temperament, family context, and set of challenges. The mentorship process therefore remains adaptive and relational while still providing clear structure, consistency, accountability, and direction.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-header-foreground/85 leading-snug max-w-xl border-t border-header-foreground/10 pt-8 mb-14">
        The relationship itself is part of the work. Trust, honesty, consistency, and psychological safety are not secondary to the process. They are central to it.
      </p>

      <!-- Process timeline -->
      <div class="space-y-0 mb-14">
        {processStages.map((stage, i) => (
          <div class="flex gap-6 md:gap-10 pb-10">
