      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 font-body text-sm md:text-base text-header-foreground/60 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        <p>The aim of this work is not dependency. Over time, the goal is for the young man to develop greater internal stability, self-awareness, responsibility, emotional maturity, and capacity to consciously navigate his own life with increasing independence and integrity.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-header-foreground/80 leading-snug max-w-xl mb-10">
